  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2hvM43r.png\" alt=\"失落城堡橫幅\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fD9cxayDNSP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/781617369285263400?label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dG7P6FV26SRGS2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PayPal-Donations-009ADC?style=for-the-badge&logo=PayPal\" alt=\"PayPal\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FMwke39lZu8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-Trailer-FF2020?style=for-the-badge&logo=YouTube&logoColor=FF2020\" alt=\"YouTube 宣傳片\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>源自「終界復刻」的舊版結構，《失落城堡》新增了一座巨大的城堡，你可以藉助行會地圖員提供的地圖來找到它。堡壘內部蘊藏著無盡的財富與謎團，屬於一個久遠前便已消逝的文明；而如今這些寶藏正由盜賊嚴密守護，他們絕不會放棄財寶，即使代價是他們的毀滅，亦或是你的末路&hellip;<br></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>＊請注意，這座城堡相當稀有，可能會在距離出生點數千格以外的地方生成。</strong></span></p>\n<p>支援版本：<br><br>Fabric 1.21.5!<br>NeoForge: 1.21.5!<br>Forge: 1.18.2, 1.19.X, 1.20.X!</p>\n<p>適用於 Fabric 1.21.5 之前的版本： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-castle-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BwHHtEH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"313\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uIGZuYH.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;undefined<span style=\"color:#fff\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>支援：</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們始終致力於關注模組中的各項問題。如果您在遊玩時遇到任何錯誤，歡迎在評論區或「問題」區塊回報，以幫助我們讓所有玩家都能享有有趣且愉快的遊戲體驗。<strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;undefined<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong>&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/D9cxayDNSP\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a> </strong></span><strong>以&nbsp;</strong><strong>加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，與我們交流、聊天、回報問題或</strong><strong>進行討論 :)</strong></span></p>",
